iengineers to solve within a time limit. Each scenario is set	/	tilde.team	70
iup in a dedicated Linux environment accessible remotely via	/	tilde.team	70
ithe SadServers web interface. The goal is to solve the	/	tilde.team	70
iscenarios and then have the solutions verified.	/	tilde.team	70
